  m_text: 'Madame Fanadi has 3 tiers of advice available, select one to generate
    a hint.


    Madame Fanadi looks at your progress to generate her hints, so
    the checks you''ve completed and items you''ve obtained are taken into account.


    Click
    "View Hints" to see the hints you''ve previously generated, and use the arrows
    on either side of her dialog box to navigate through them. Click "Got it" to
    generate another hint.


    Rupee Mode: Gain rupees as you complete checks to
    spend on hints. Some checks are worth more than others! This mode can be turned
    on and off in General Settings.'
